# Go source must always be checked out with LF line endings: gofmt's
# output uses LF, so a CRLF working tree (the default on Windows runners
# via core.autocrlf) makes `gofmt -l .` flag every file and fail CI.
*.go text eol=lf
# Shell scripts must stay LF so they run correctly on Linux runners.
*.sh text eol=lf
